ck spent the last moves around J5, H6 and H8 while the score stayed near +14."}]}, "audit": {"by": "Sonnet 5.5", "verdict": "clean", "reason": "libs.py parses a pasted board and prints each group's stones and liberty count with a danger flag, and count.py flood-fills empty regions to tally area score with named dead stones removed; both only inspect the current position and never generate, score or rank candidate moves or look ahead.", "stop": false}}